{"3160920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bungo Bash", "steam_appid": 3160920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/b3a259773a380fdb2e5d28d9eb895cd9.avif?t=1777841029\" width=1024 height=307 /></span><strong><u>These Bungos are not messing around</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pummel your friends with over the top attacks, huge combos and giant frying pans!???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/1111bbae19d9998ddc79b445817ee747.poster.avif?t=1777841029\" aria-label=\"Bungo Bash combo attack\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/1111bbae19d9998ddc79b445817ee747.webm?t=1777841029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/1111bbae19d9998ddc79b445817ee747.mp4?t=1777841029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/bf2d247ce81f32ca8a7d41b8e104a8ea.avif?t=1777841029\" width=1024 height=596 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u> </u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160920/extras/ade83b00e59f83e5a14886d535b15f37.avif?t=1777841029\" width=1024 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Supa Fun Items!</u></strong></